# Felwood - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every rank-flagged rare spawning in Felwood (7, zone key 1448) and
# every fixed treasure object (5), verified against the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever NPC/object/item dumps). Rares with 2+
# points loop over ALL data-confirmed points; single-point rares get
# plain steps. Every goal is optional - a missing spawn never wedges
# the guide. Signature drops (Sinslayer's two sole drops) ride as
# optional collects; everything else gets a kill-note, with a pointer
# to the core guide where the rare drops a core quest item (Death Howl
# and Mongress drop Silvery Claws for core 4084; no core quest takes
# any of these rares as giver, ender, or kill objective). No tame lines:
# tameability has no data flag and the core guide carries no tame
# corroboration (logged in docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn
# timers are unconfirmed everywhere. No accept/turnin lines anywhere.
guide butler-routes-completionist/felwood-rares
title Felwood - Rares & Treasures
levels 45-55
zone Felwood
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords felwood, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step The northern wilds - Lord Sinslayer

  zone map 1448

  goto 40.5,9.5
  kill 7017 optional
  collect 14146 "Gloves of Spell Mastery" optional
  collect 284177 "Sinslayer's Smasher" optional
  note Lord Sinslayer (level 16) is far below the 45-55 band - any band-level character one-shots him. Both drops are his sole drops anywhere in the data.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Battered Chest run - north

  zone map 1448

  loop
  goto 39.7,10.8
  goto 40.6,10
  goto 41.9,8.8
  interact 106319 optional
  note The Battered Chest is one generic object at three fixed northern points - usual chest fare, nothing unique.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Timbermaw road - Olm the Wise

  zone map 1448

  goto 50.17,32.81
