  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Shadow Hold - Arko'niran's Chest

  zone map 1448

  goto 37.84,52.75
  interact 176225 optional
  note Arko'niran's Chest sits in Shadow Hold by Captured Arko'narin (core 5202/5203 ground). Its loot is not in the data - check in game, nothing invented here.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

